WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.100
-Welcome back, everybody,
I'm here with Chance the Rapper.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:09.033
And we're about to go head
to head in a new game called

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:12.501
"Peanut Butter and
'That's My Jam' Tic-Tac-Toe".

00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:16.767
-♪ Peanut Butter
'That's My Jam' Tic-Tac-Toe ♪

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:18.834
-Now, this is just
like regular tic-tac-toe,

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:20.033
but with an added challenge.

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:22.534
Each square contains
a piece of bread coated

00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:24.467
with peanut butter and jam.

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:26.100
Instead of drawing an "X"
or an "O",

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.567
you have to bounce
a ping pong ball

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:30.200
and get it to stick to
the top of the slice of bread.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.767
It doesn't matter if another
ball has already landed

00:00:32.767 --> 00:00:35.968
on the bread, whoever gets
three in a row first wins.

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:37.133
Chance, you ready for this?

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:39.033
-I think so.
I just realized that it's jam,

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:43.334
like "That's My Jam",
which premieres tomorrow!

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:45.868
-See how slick I am?
-That's sick, that's sick.

00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:47.133
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
-I'm ready.

00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:49.133
-All right, since you're
our guest, you can go first.

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:51.167
-Oh, really?
All the pressure's on.

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:52.334
All right, here we go.

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:54.367
Oh, that was too hard.
All right.

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:56.534
These are a different kind
of ping pong balls.

00:00:56.534 --> 00:00:58.067
-Yeah, they've got extra bounce.

00:00:59.033 --> 00:01:01.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:05.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:11.567
[ Laughs ]
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:12.767
-All right, where do I go here?

00:01:12.767 --> 00:01:15.667
The center one?

00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:18.200
-What is the --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:20.100
♪♪

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.167
Oh!

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:22.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:22.701 --> 00:01:24.267
-Now that counts, right,
that counts.

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:25.534
-Yeah, we both got
that middle one.

00:01:25.534 --> 00:01:28.267
♪♪

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:30.067
-We can just quit now,
if you want.

00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:31.300
-No, go ahead, I don't --

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.834
♪♪

00:01:33.834 --> 00:01:34.968
Oh, my God, what's that?

00:01:34.968 --> 00:01:37.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.834 --> 00:01:40.367
-All right, I can still win,
I can still win.

00:01:40.367 --> 00:01:42.234
-Oh, no! Oh, my God!
-Oh, it fell off!

00:01:42.234 --> 00:01:44.200
-Hey, come on.
That's ridiculous.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.734
-That -- It's gone, right?
It's gone.

00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:47.434
-Guys, don't cheer that loud.

00:01:47.434 --> 00:01:49.100
-Let's go. Here we go.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.701
Oh, I was so close.

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:56.501
♪♪

00:01:56.501 --> 00:01:58.334
-I don't know what happened me.

00:01:58.334 --> 00:02:01.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:01.434 --> 00:02:02.901
What!

00:02:02.901 --> 00:02:04.534
[ Cheers and applause ]
The winner!

00:02:04.534 --> 00:02:07.100
-Let's go!

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.167
-Man, that was awesome.

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:10.701
Chance the Rapper, everybody.

00:02:10.701 --> 00:02:13.100
"The Voice" airs Mondays
at 8 P.M.,

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.634
Tuesdays at 9 P.M. on NBC.

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:17.968
We'll be right back
with Maude Apatow.

00:02:17.968 --> 00:02:19.033
How did you know how to do that?

00:02:19.033 --> 00:02:21.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.267 --> 00:02:28.801
♪♪

